{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LineSubject"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TextAndRandomness"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A line’s subject is a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"type"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", and this protocol closes the set of them:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Line","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"’s parameter is constrained to it, so a shape nobody has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"classified does not compile. Before it, an unclassified shape compiled,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shipped, and failed a reflection sweep that had to be taught every new arm","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by hand, in three files.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The one requirement is the sweep’s, and that is the point rather than a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leak. ","type":"text"},{"code":"GnustoTestSupport","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" walks every stock line looking for one a game left","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the engine’s voice, and it can only do that if it can ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"print"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" each line —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which means having something to hand it. A subject that cannot supply its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own exa